/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Eighth[14]- <-> Tenth[55]- (record
goctad:E10@T27-, e = -1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGoctadE10T27nHX` and `wGoctadE10T27nGX` (divided by
`2 ^ 25` and `2 ^ 21`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per
column; the parts evaluate no word image. -/

